    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎃 Haunting Alert (full)\n\nBefore activating:\n1. Attach the **Header Auth**, **Google Sheets** and **Gmail** credentials (all say REPLACE ME).\n2. Set the spreadsheet ID on both Sheets nodes (tabs: `Hunt Ledger`, `Hunt Errors`).\n3. Set the Gmail **To** address to your demo inbox.\n4. Settings → Error workflow → `🧯 Hunt Errors`.\n\nInvalid payloads, Sheets failures and Gmail failures all land in **Hunt Errors**.",
